        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅰ問　反復試行で定まる複素数（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "問1",
                "value": "ア 2／イ 3／ウ 2／エ 2／オ 2／カ 3／キ 4"
              },
              {
                "label": "問2",
                "value": "ク 1350"
              },
              {
                "label": "問3",
                "value": "ケ 507"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問1　確率と複素数を分けて整理する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初の一手",
            "text": "4以下が出る確率は \\(2/3\\)、5または6が出る確率は \\(1/3\\) です。まず確率を二項分布で表し、次に複素数の絶対値と偏角を整理します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P_{n,k}={}_nC_k\\left(\\frac23\\right)^k\\left(\\frac13\\right)^{n-k}={}_nC_k\\frac{2^k}{3^n}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z_{n,k}=2^{\\frac{2k-n}{2}}\\left\\{\\cos\\left(\\frac{3k-n}{4}\\pi\\right)+i\\sin\\left(\\frac{3k-n}{4}\\pi\\right)\\right\\}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2　隣接確率の比を1と比較する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{P_{2025,k+1}}{P_{2025,k}}=\\frac{2(2025-k)}{k+1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "比が1より大きい間は増加し、1より小さくなると減少します。境目から最大は \\(k=1350\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問3　純虚数条件を整数方程式へ直す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{3k-2025}{4}\\pi=\\frac\\pi2+m\\pi\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad3k-4m=2027",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "整数解を \\(k=4l-2027\\) と表し、\\(0\\le k\\le2025\\) を課すと \\(507\\le l\\le1013\\) です。よって個数は507です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅱ問　正四面体と空間ベクトル（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "問1",
                "value": "ア \\(\\frac12\\)／イ \\(\\frac12\\)／ウ \\(0\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "問2",
                "value": "エ \\(\\frac12\\)／オ \\(\\frac13\\)／カ \\(\\frac16\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "問3",
                "value": "キ \\(\\frac{\\sqrt3-1}{2}\\)／ク \\(\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{3}\\)／ケ \\(\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{6}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "問4",
                "value": "\\(x=\\frac{2-\\sqrt3}{4}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問1　辺長を内積へ直す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "正三角形と余弦定理を使うと、\\(\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=1/2\\)、\\(\\vec b\\cdot\\vec c=1/2\\)、\\(\\vec c\\cdot\\vec a=0\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問4への準備　HとIを同じ平面で扱う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{AH}=-\\frac12\\vec a+\\frac13\\vec b+\\frac16\\vec c",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{AI}=(3-\\sqrt3)\\overrightarrow{AH}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "これによりO、A、D、H、Iは同一平面上にあります。DからOHへ下ろした垂線の足をJとし、面積を底辺と高さに分けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "図の確認",
            "text": "内部版では原本の平面・交点関係図を照合できます。公開候補へ原本クロップは出しません。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-djhi-plane",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問4　面積条件からxを求める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(JH:OH=(1-x):1\\) と、原本の長さ計算 \\(|OH|=\\sqrt6/3\\)、\\(|AH|=\\sqrt3/3\\) を使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\frac{\\sqrt2(2-\\sqrt3)}6(1-x)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\sqrt2}{24}=\\frac{\\sqrt2(2-\\sqrt3)}6(1-x)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=\\frac{2-\\sqrt3}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2　垂線の足Hを係数で置く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\overrightarrow{OH}=s\\vec a+t\\vec b+u\\vec c\\)、\\(s+t+u=1\\) と置き、OHとAB、ACの内積を0にします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{OH}=\\frac12\\vec a+\\frac13\\vec b+\\frac16\\vec c",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-tetrahedron",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問3　内心の比を位置ベクトルへ移す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "直線AIと辺BCの交点をKとします。内心より \\(BK:KC=1:2\\)、角の二等分線より \\(AI:IK=\\sqrt3:1\\) を用います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{OI}=\\frac{\\sqrt3-1}{2}\\vec a+\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{3}\\vec b+\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{6}\\vec c",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-incenter",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅲ問　座標空間における2点間距離の最小値（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "問1",
                "value": "ア 0／イ 0／ウ \\(\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{2}}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "問2",
                "value": "エ 5"
              },
              {
                "label": "問3",
                "value": "オ 1／カ 5／キ 0"
              },
              {
                "label": "問4",
                "value": "ク 2／ケ \\(\\frac35\\)／コ \\(\\frac45\\)／サ \\(\\sqrt{17}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問1　媒介変数を消去して断面円を作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Rは \\((2p^2+2q^2,p,q)\\) です。平面 \\(x=k\\) では \\(2p^2+2q^2=k\\) となります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y^2+z^2=\\frac{k}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "したがって断面は中心 \\((k,0,0)\\)、半径 \\(\\sqrt{k/2}\\) の円です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2・問3　軸への距離と回転",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AH=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5,\\qquad B=(1,5,0)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問4　固定点Bから断面円までの距離を最小化する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|BX_k|^2=(2p^2-1)^2+(p-5)^2=4p^4-3p^2-10p+26",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{d}{dp}|BX_k|^2=2(p-1)(8p^2+8p+5)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "第2因子は常に正なので、最小は \\(p=1\\)、距離の2乗は17です。回転を元へ戻すと座標も得られます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-space-geometry",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-yz-projection",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問4　回転を元へ戻す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "X=\\left(2,\\frac35,\\frac45\\right),\\qquad |AX|=\\sqrt{17}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "別解",
            "text": "原本には断面円を三角関数で媒介し、合成後に \\(t=\\sqrt{2k}\\) として最小化する別解があります。主解法の後に同じ結論を確認します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|AX_k|^2\\ge k^2-\\frac32k+26-5\\sqrt{2k}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問1〜問3の要点をつなぐ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "平面断面を円と見ること、点Aをx軸周りに回転してBへ移すことにより、空間の最短距離を平面内の円と点の問題へ移しました。問4ではこの構造を保ったまま微分しています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅳ問　積分方程式と偶奇分解（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問1　\\(-x\\) を代入して偶奇性を確かめる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b(-x)=b(x),\\qquad c(-x)=-c(x)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "定義に \\(-x\\) を代入し、加法の順序と差の符号を整理すれば証明できます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2 (1)　積分方程式を差分商へ直す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "条件(ii)を移項して \\(f(x+h)-f(x)\\) を作り、hで割って極限を取ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(x)=-g(x)f(x)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2 (2)　gの原始関数を対数の差で作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "G(x)=\\log\\frac{2(1+e^x)}{3+\\cos x}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問2 (3)　積分因子で積を一定にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(h(x)=e^{G(x)}f(x)\\) と置くと、積の微分で2項が打ち消し合います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "h'(x)=e^{G(x)}\\{G'(x)f(x)+f'(x)\\}=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)=2e^{-G(x)}=\\frac{3+\\cos x}{1+e^x}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問3　偶関数部分と奇関数部分に分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初の一手",
            "text": "問1の分解を \\(a=f\\) に使います。対称区間では奇関数部分の積分が0になるため、直接積分を避けられます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b(x)=\\frac12\\{f(x)+f(-x)\\}=\\frac12(3+\\cos x)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}f(x)\\,dx=2\\int_0^\\pi b(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^\\pi(3+\\cos x)\\,dx=3\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "原本の補足解説",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本は問2 (2)について、\\(g(x)\\) を2つの対数微分へ分けて原始関数を導いています。学習者向け版でもその順序を保ちます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p011",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "問3　対称区間の公式を確認する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_{-a}^{a}b(x)\\,dx=2\\int_0^a b(x)\\,dx,\\qquad \\int_{-a}^{a}c(x)\\,dx=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "問1で示した偶奇性を使えば、問2で得た関数の定積分は短く計算できます。結論は \\(3\\pi\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "講評からの学び",
            "text": "原本講評は、全体の計算量は例年より少ない一方、高得点にはスピードと正確さが必要としています。第Ⅱ問4と第Ⅲ問4を後回しにし、独立短問と誘導の強い第Ⅳ問を先に確保する方針が有効です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
